# ForgeTrail lessons + anti-patterns (MCP)

**Workflow:** **`forgetrail-lessons-gate.mdc`** defines when to run tools. This file adds density when editing app code.

For CLI, schema, publication, or site copy work:

1. **`searchLessons`** — short keyword queries (`empty state copy`, `schema drift`, `filesystem safety`).
2. **`getAntiPatterns`** — skim for vague errors, schema drift, untested refactors.

**When to skip:** trivial one-line edits or an explicit request not to broaden scope.
